    "mm_pdp_herkunft_section": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{{ 'mm-pdp-herkunft2.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}\n<section class=\"mm-hk\">\n  <div class=\"mm-hk-wrap\">\n    <h2 class=\"mm-hk-title\">Vom Bio&#8209;Hof der Schw&auml;bischen Alb in deine Hand</h2>\n    <p class=\"mm-hk-lead\">Rindertalg galt seit Jahrtausenden als Goldstandard der Hautpflege. Wir holen dieses Wissen zur&uuml;ck - reduziert auf das, was deine Haut wirklich braucht.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mm-hk-hero\">\n    <img src=\"https://menmansion.com/cdn/shop/files/mm-hk-hof.png?width=1000\" alt=\"Men Mansion Gr&uuml;nder mit Bio-Weiderind auf dem Hof\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1250\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <div class=\"mm-hk-hero-grad\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mm-hk-hero-cap\">\n      <p class=\"mm-hk-hero-place\">Schw&auml;bische Alb</p>\n      <p class=\"mm-hk-hero-sub\">Partner-Metzgerei, grasgef&uuml;tterte Bio-Rinder</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mm-hk-wrap mm-hk-steps-head\">\n    <h3 class=\"mm-hk-steps-title\">Der Weg in die Dose</h3>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mm-hk-scroll\" id=\"mm-hk-scroll\">\n    <article class=\"mm-hk-card\">\n      <div class=\"mm-hk-card-img\"><img src=\"https://menmansion.com/cdn/shop/files/mm-hk-ursprung.png?width=700\" alt=\"Tallow Gesichtscreme neben Rindfleisch\" width=\"1000\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n      <div class=\"mm-hk-card-body\">\n        <p class=\"mm-hk-step\">Ursprung</p>\n        <h3 class=\"mm-hk-card-title\">Rindertalg vom Weiderind</h3>\n        <p class=\"mm-hk-card-text\">Von grasgef&uuml;tterten Bio-Rindern, die auf der Weide stehen.</p>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"mm-hk-card\">\n      <div class=\"mm-hk-card-img\"><img src=\"https://menmansion.com/cdn/shop/files/mm-hk-metzgerei.png?width=700\" alt=\"Men Mansion Gr&uuml;nder mit dem Metzger\" width=\"1000\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n      <div class=\"mm-hk-card-body\">\n        <p class=\"mm-hk-step\">Handwerk</p>\n        <h3 class=\"mm-hk-card-title\">Eine Metzgerei, ein Partner</h3>\n        <p class=\"mm-hk-card-text\">Unser Talg kommt aus einem Betrieb, den wir pers&ouml;nlich kennen.</p>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"mm-hk-card\">\n      <div class=\"mm-hk-card-img\"><img src=\"https://menmansion.com/cdn/shop/files/mm-hk-zutaten.png?width=700\" alt=\"Honig, &Ouml;l und Bienenwachs neben der Tallow Gesichtscreme\" width=\"1000\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n      <div class=\"mm-hk-card-body\">\n        <p class=\"mm-hk-step\">Veredelung</p>\n        <h3 class=\"mm-hk-card-title\">Nat&uuml;rlich veredelt</h3>\n        <p class=\"mm-hk-card-text\">Veredelt mit nat&uuml;rlichen Zutaten regionaler Anbieter.</p>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mm-hk-dots\" id=\"mm-hk-dots\">\n    <button type=\"button\" data-i=\"0\" aria-label=\"Ursprung\" aria-current=\"true\"><span></span></button>\n    <button type=\"button\" data-i=\"1\" aria-label=\"Handwerk\" aria-current=\"false\"><span></span></button>\n    <button type=\"button\" data-i=\"2\" aria-label=\"Veredelung\" aria-current=\"false\"><span></span></button>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mm-hk-wrap\">\n    <details class=\"mm-hk-more\">\n      <summary>\n        <span>Die ganze Geschichte</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-hk-plus\"><span class=\"mm-hk-plus-open\">+</span><span class=\"mm-hk-plus-close\">&minus;</span></span>\n      </summary>\n      <div class=\"mm-hk-more-body\">\n        <p>Unsere Creme entsteht auf der Schw&auml;bischen Alb in einer kleinen Metzgerei, die uns mit Rindertalg von grasgef&uuml;tterten Bio-Rindern versorgt. In kleinen Chargen fertigen wir daraus unsere Pflege mit viel Sorgfalt und Pr&auml;zision, veredelt mit nat&uuml;rlichen Inhaltsstoffen von regionalen Anbietern.</p>\n        <p>Pflege, reduziert auf das Wesentliche: kein Wasser, keine F&uuml;llstoffe, keine Duftstoff-Kaskaden. Nur das, was die Haut kennt.</p>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var s = document.getElementById('mm-hk-scroll');\n  var d = document.getElementById('mm-hk-dots');\n  if (!s || !d) return;\n  var btns = d.querySelectorAll('button');\n\n  function step() {\n    return s.children.length > 1 ? s.children[1].offsetLeft - s.children[0].offsetLeft : s.children[0].offsetWidth;\n  }\n  function sync() {\n    var scrollable = s.scrollWidth - s.clientWidth > 8;\n    d.style.display = scrollable ? '' : 'none';\n    if (!scrollable) return;\n    var w = step();\n    if (!w) return;\n    var i = Math.max(0, Math.min(btns.length - 1, Math.round(s.scrollLeft / w)));\n    for (var n = 0; n < btns.length; n++) {\n      btns[n].setAttribute('aria-current', n === i ? 'true' : 'false');\n    }\n  }\n  for (var b = 0; b < btns.length; b++) {\n    btns[b].addEventListener('click', function () {\n      var el = s.children[+this.dataset.i];\n      if (el) s.scrollTo({ left: el.offsetLeft - s.offsetLeft, behavior: 'smooth' });\n    });\n  }\n  s.addEventListener('scroll', sync, { passive: true });\n  window.addEventListener('resize', sync);\n  sync();\n})();\n</script>",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "mm_pdp_routine_section": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{{ 'mm-pdp-routine3.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}\n<section class=\"mm-r3\" id=\"mm-pdp-routine-anchor\">\n  <div class=\"mm-r3-inner\">\n\n    <header class=\"mm-r3-head\">\n      <h2 class=\"mm-r3-title\">Gepflegte Haut.<br><span>In 3 Schritten</span></h2>\n      <p class=\"mm-r3-sub\">Deine tägliche Routine - einfach, effektiv, natürlich.</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <ol class=\"mm-r3-track\" id=\"mm-r3-track\">\n\n      <li class=\"mm-r3-card\">\n        <div class=\"mm-r3-media\">\n          <img src=\"https://menmansion.com/cdn/shop/files/IMG_1680.jpg?v=1775741337&width=800\" alt=\"Gesicht mit der Aleppo-Seife reinigen\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\">\n          <span class=\"mm-r3-fade\"></span>\n          <span class=\"mm-r3-num\">01</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mm-r3-body\">\n          <div class=\"mm-r3-row\"><h3>Reinigen</h3></div>\n          <p>Gesicht mit der Aleppo-Seife und lauwarmem Wasser reinigen – löst Schmutz und überschüssigen Talg. Bereitet die Haut sanft vor, ohne sie auszutrocknen.</p>\n          <div class=\"mm-r3-foot\"><img class=\"mm-r3-thumb\" src=\"{{ 'mm-r3-aleppo.png' | asset_url }}\" alt=\"Aleppo Seife\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n\n      <li class=\"mm-r3-card\">\n        <div class=\"mm-r3-media\">\n          <img src=\"https://menmansion.com/cdn/shop/files/IMG_1502_3.jpg?v=1775510634&width=800\" alt=\"Tallow Gesichtscreme einmassieren\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\">\n          <span class=\"mm-r3-fade\"></span>\n          <span class=\"mm-r3-num\">02</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mm-r3-body\">\n          <div class=\"mm-r3-row\"><h3>Sanft einmassieren</h3></div>\n          <p>Die Tallow Gesichtscreme in einer kleinen Menge einmassieren. Die hautähnlichen Lipide stärken die Barriere und ziehen vollständig ein.</p>\n          <div class=\"mm-r3-foot\">\n            <img class=\"mm-r3-thumb\" src=\"{{ 'mm-tallow-tiegel.png' | asset_url }}\" alt=\"Tallow Gesichtscreme\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n\n      <li class=\"mm-r3-card\">\n        <div class=\"mm-r3-media\">\n          <img src=\"https://menmansion.com/cdn/shop/files/Unknown_1edbc7b1-af96-47cb-8384-55744279e3f8.jpg?v=1775510657&width=800\" alt=\"Tallow Gesichtscreme täglich anwenden\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\">\n          <span class=\"mm-r3-fade\"></span>\n          <span class=\"mm-r3-num\">03</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mm-r3-body\">\n          <div class=\"mm-r3-row\"><h3>Täglich anwenden</h3></div>\n          <p>Morgens und abends nach dem Waschen auftragen. Keine komplizierte Routine, kein Aufwand.</p>\n        </div>\n      </li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <div class=\"mm-r3-dots\" id=\"mm-r3-dots\" hidden>\n      <button type=\"button\" data-i=\"0\" aria-label=\"Schritt 1\"><span></span></button>\n      <button type=\"button\" data-i=\"1\" aria-label=\"Schritt 2\"><span></span></button>\n      <button type=\"button\" data-i=\"2\" aria-label=\"Schritt 3\"><span></span></button>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var track = document.getElementById('mm-r3-track');\n  var dots  = document.getElementById('mm-r3-dots');\n  if (!track || !dots || !track.children.length) return;\n  var btns = dots.querySelectorAll('button');\n\n  function stepWidth() {\n    if (track.children.length > 1) {\n      return track.children[1].offsetLeft - track.children[0].offsetLeft;\n    }\n    return track.children[0].getBoundingClientRect().width;\n  }\n\n  function sync() {\n    var scrollable = track.scrollWidth - track.clientWidth > 8;\n    dots.hidden = !scrollable;\n    if (!scrollable) return;\n    var step = stepWidth();\n    if (!step) return;\n    var i = Math.min(btns.length - 1, Math.round(track.scrollLeft / step));\n    for (var n = 0; n < btns.length; n++) {\n      btns[n].setAttribute('aria-current', n === i ? 'true' : 'false');\n    }\n  }\n\n  for (var b = 0; b < btns.length; b++) {\n    btns[b].addEventListener('click', function () {\n      var el = track.children[+this.dataset.i];\n      if (el) track.scrollTo({ left: el.offsetLeft - track.offsetLeft, behavior: 'smooth' });\n    });\n  }\n\n  track.addEventListener('scroll', sync, { passive: true });\n  window.addEventListener('resize', sync);\n  sync();\n})();\n</script>",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "mm_pdp_comparison_section": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"mm-pdp-compare\">\n  \n  <h2 class=\"mm-pdp-compare-title\">Men Mansion vs.<br>andere Marken</h2>\n  <div class=\"mm-pdp-compare-table\">\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-compare-row mm-pdp-compare-head\">\n      <span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-head-why\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-why-label\">Warum</span>{%- if settings.logo != blank -%}<img class=\"mm-pdp-compare-logo\" src=\"{{ settings.logo | image_url: width: 300 }}\" alt=\"{{ shop.name }}\" loading=\"lazy\">{%- else -%}<span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-why-name\">Men Mansion</span>{%- endif -%}</span>\n      <span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-head-mm\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-thumb\"><img src=\"{{ 'mm-tallow-tiegel.png' | asset_url }}\" alt=\"Men Mansion Tallow Gesichtscreme\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"46\" height=\"46\"></span></span>\n      <span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-head-other\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-thumb\"><img src=\"{{ 'mm-andere-tiegel.png' | asset_url }}\" alt=\"Andere Marken\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"46\" height=\"46\"></span></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-compare-row\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-label\">Handgefertigt in kleinen Chargen</span><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-cell-us\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-badge mm-pdp-compare-badge--yes\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M3 8.5L6.5 12L13 4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></span><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-cell-them\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-badge mm-pdp-compare-badge--no\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M4 4L12 12M12 4L4 12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-compare-row\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-label\">Natürliche Wirkstoffe</span><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-cell-us\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-badge mm-pdp-compare-badge--yes\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M3 8.5L6.5 12L13 4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></span><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-cell-them\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-badge mm-pdp-compare-badge--no\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M4 4L12 12M12 4L4 12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-compare-row\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-label\">Enthält Silikone &amp; Mineralöl</span><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-cell-us\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-badge mm-pdp-compare-badge--no\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M4 4L12 12M12 4L4 12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></span><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-cell-them\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-badge mm-pdp-compare-badge--yes\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M3 8.5L6.5 12L13 4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-compare-row\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-label\">Eigene Manufaktur, keine Massenware</span><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-cell-us\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-badge mm-pdp-compare-badge--yes\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M3 8.5L6.5 12L13 4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></span><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-cell-them\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-badge mm-pdp-compare-badge--no\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M4 4L12 12M12 4L4 12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-compare-row\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-label\">Sichtbare Ergebnisse nach wenigen Tagen</span><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-cell-us\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-badge mm-pdp-compare-badge--yes\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M3 8.5L6.5 12L13 4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></span><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-cell-them\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-badge mm-pdp-compare-badge--no\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M4 4L12 12M12 4L4 12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></span></div>\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-compare-row\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-label\">Künstliche Duft- &amp; Farbstoffe</span><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-cell-us\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-badge mm-pdp-compare-badge--no\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M4 4L12 12M12 4L4 12\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></span><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-cell-them\"><span class=\"mm-pdp-compare-badge mm-pdp-compare-badge--yes\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M3 8.5L6.5 12L13 4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "mm_pdp_faq_section": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"mm-pdp-faq\">\n  \n  <h2 class=\"mm-pdp-faq-title\">Deine Fragen. Unsere Antworten.</h2>\n  <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion\">\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-row\" data-mm-accordion>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-head\" data-mm-accordion-toggle>\n        <span class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-label\">Was ist Tallow und warum wirkt es?</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-mark\" data-mm-accordion-mark>+</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-body\" data-mm-accordion-body hidden>\n        <p>Hochwertiger Rindertalg von der Schwäbischen Alb - biologisch nahezu identisch mit den natürlichen Lipiden deiner Haut, daher keine Barriere und direkte Wirkung.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-row\" data-mm-accordion>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-head\" data-mm-accordion-toggle>\n        <span class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-label\">Welche Inhaltsstoffe sind enthalten?</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-mark\" data-mm-accordion-mark>+</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-body\" data-mm-accordion-body hidden>\n        <p>Rindertalg, Schwarzkümmelöl, Traubenkernöl, Bienenwachs und Squalan, abgerundet mit einer dezenten Duftkomposition aus Bergamotte und Zedernholz.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-row\" data-mm-accordion>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-head\" data-mm-accordion-toggle>\n        <span class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-label\">Für welchen Hauttyp eignet sich die Creme?</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-mark\" data-mm-accordion-mark>+</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-body\" data-mm-accordion-body hidden>\n        <p>Für trockene, empfindliche, unreine und normale Haut.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-row\" data-mm-accordion>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-head\" data-mm-accordion-toggle>\n        <span class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-label\">Wie lange dauert der Versand?</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-mark\" data-mm-accordion-mark>+</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-body\" data-mm-accordion-body hidden>\n        <p>Versand aus unserem Lager in Rottenburg, Deutschland - innerhalb von 1–2 Werktagen nach Auftragseingang. Lieferzeit in Deutschland, Österreich und der Schweiz: 2–4 Werktage. Kostenloser Versand ab 60 € Bestellwert.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-row\" data-mm-accordion>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-head\" data-mm-accordion-toggle>\n        <span class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-label\">Was, wenn mir das Produkt nicht gefällt?</span>\n        <span class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-mark\" data-mm-accordion-mark>+</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-accordion-body\" data-mm-accordion-body hidden>\n        <p>Du hast 30 Tage Zeit, das Produkt zurückzuschicken - ohne Wenn und Aber. Das ist unser Versprechen.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "mm_pdp_reviews_header_section": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{%- liquid\n  assign rating = product.metafields.loox.avg_rating\n  assign review_count = product.metafields.loox.num_reviews\n  if rating != blank\n    assign rating_display = rating | replace: '.', ','\n    assign rounded = rating | round\n  else\n    assign rating_display = '4,8'\n    assign review_count = 398\n    assign rounded = 5\n  endif\n-%}\n<div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews\">\n  <div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-head\">\n    <div>\n      \n      <h2 class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-title\">Was Männer über uns sagen</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-summary\">\n      <span class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-avg\">{{ rating_display }}</span>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-summary-body\">\n        <div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-stars\">{% for i in (1..5) %}{% if i <= rounded %}★{% else %}<span style=\"color:var(--mm-graphite)\">★</span>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>\n        <div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-total\">{{ review_count }} verifizierte Bewertungen</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-spotlight\">\n    <span class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-badge\">Top-Bewertung</span>\n    <div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-spotlight-body\">\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-spotlight-quote\">„Endlich eine Creme, die nicht fettet“</div>\n      <p class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-spotlight-text\">Meine Haut fühlt sich nach 2 Wochen deutlich ruhiger und gepflegter an. Absolut&nbsp;empfehlenswert!</p>\n      <div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-author\">\n        <span class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-avatar\">M</span>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-author-name\">Markus T. <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"11\" fill=\"var(--mm-gold-soft)\"></circle><path d=\"M7 12.5l3 3 7-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--mm-onyx)\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div>\n          <div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-author-meta\">Verifiziert · Tallow Gesichtscreme</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-more-head\">\n    \n    <span class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-swipe-hint\">Wischen →</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div\n    class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-grid\"\n    data-mm-reviews-grid\n    data-product-id=\"{{ product.id }}\"\n    data-fallback-image=\"{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 400 }}\"\n    data-fallback-product-name=\"{{ product.title | escape }}\"\n  ></div>\n  <div class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-more-wrap\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-pdp-reviews-cta mm-pdp-reviews-more\" data-mm-reviews-more hidden>Mehr Bewertungen</button>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
    "1772107123a1310b71": {
      "type": "apps",
